apeis-de-parede/storm-samurai-standoff-daef3eb9366f411b.html"}, {"alt": "Instrumento cient\u00edfico vintage de lat\u00e3o sobre mesa de madeira com pap\u00e9is escritos \u00e0 m\u00e3o.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/antique-spectrometer-study-2ef0107fd8f7bce0.jpg", "url": "/papeis-de-parede/estudo-de-espectrometro-antigo-2ef0107fd8f7bce0.html"}, {"alt": "Uma constela\u00e7\u00e3o c\u00f3smica moldada por gal\u00e1xias brilhantes e nebulosas em vibrantes tons de roxo, azul e rosa.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/cosmic-pi-galaxy-230f44ccb204491f.jpg", "url": "/papeis-de-parede/galaxia-pi-cosmica-230f44ccb204491f.html"}, {"alt": "Uma brilhante explos\u00e3o c\u00f3smica irradiando atrav\u00e9s de nebulosas coloridas no espa\u00e7o profundo.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/galactic-shockwave-blaze-ef6fa15543ca1d76.jpg", "url": "/papeis-de-parede/onda-de-choque-galactica-chama-ef6fa15543ca1d76.html"}, {"alt": "Param\u00e9dico atendendo um paciente em uma ambul\u00e2ncia com equipamento m\u00e9dico.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/inside-emergency-care-5b86bb0bc8b68e09.jpg", "url": "/papeis-de-parede/dentro-do-atendimento-de-emergencia-5b86bb0bc8b68e09.html"}, {"alt": "Post-it azul preso a quadro de corti\u00e7a com alfinete vermelho.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/blue-note-red-pin-31c011f36bb04d25.jpg", "url": "/papeis-de-parede/nota-azul-alfinete-vermelho-31c011f36bb04d25.html"}, {"alt": "Um CD brilhante refletindo cores de arco-\u00edris em uma superf\u00edcie preta.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/rainbow-on-the-disc-8db345a2173c7114.jpg", "url": "/papeis-de-parede/arco-iris-no-disco-8db345a2173c7114.html"}, {"alt": "Ve\u00edculo off-road laranja dirigindo atrav\u00e9s de po\u00e7a de lama na floresta.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/mud-splash-adventure-ef4b3c7b3bc72216.jpg", "url": "/papeis-de-parede/mud-splash-adventure-ef4b3c7b3bc72216.html"}, {"alt": "Um homem musculoso em uma academia se preparando para levantar uma barra pesada.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/iron-grip-2e4b8244d68d9dbc.jpg", "url": "/papeis-de-parede/iron-grip-2e4b8244d68d9dbc.html"}, {"alt": "Oleiro moldando argila em uma roda cercado por vasos de cer\u00e2mica acabados em um est\u00fadio r\u00fastico.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/hands-in-clay-57e1aaddfd4dce16.jpg", "url": "/papeis-de-parede/maos-em-argila-57e1aaddfd4dce16.html"}, {"alt": "Surfista desliza em uma onda sobre recife de coral colorido em \u00e1gua azul clara.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/carving-the-turquoise-wave-43fa237950243881.jpg", "url": "/papeis-de-parede/esculpindo-a-onda-turquesa-43fa237950243881.html"}, {"alt": "\u00d4nibus escolar amarelo abandonado coberto de hera em uma floresta densa.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/abandoned-forest-bus-7831d67ca76dacd5.jpg", "url": "/papeis-de-parede/onibus-florestal-abandonado-7831d67ca76dacd5.html"}, {"alt": "Trabalhadores soldam vigas de a\u00e7o em uma ponte sob um c\u00e9u azul com um caminh\u00e3o de entrega amarelo por perto.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/isometric-bridge-builder-afc346289fb0ab4a.jpg", "url": "/papeis-de-parede/construtor-de-pontes-isometrico-afc346289fb0ab4a.html"}, {"alt": "Caminh\u00e3o Iveco dirigindo em rodovia no deserto levantando poeira ao p\u00f4r do sol.", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/desert-highway-stralis-dff942e2f4aafaa4.jpg", "url": "/papeis-de-parede/desert-highway-stralis-dff942e2f4aafaa4.html"}, {"alt": "Rover de Marte explorando desfiladeiro empoeirado ao p\u00f4r do sol", "thumb_url": "https://wallpapers.com/images/thumbnail/mars-canyon-sunset-rover-eb7d904c002512c1.jpg", "url": "/papeis-de-parede/mars-canyon-sunset-rover-eb7d904c002512c1.html"}, {"alt": "Uma esta\u00e7\u00e3o 